## Environment Variables
- `OPENAI_API_KEY` - For LLM operations
- `OLLAMA_HOST` - For local models (default: host.docker.internal:11434)
- `QDRANT_URL` - Vector database endpoint
- `APP_ENV=local` - Environment setting